The biggest threat on Fire/Air if you stay to long is an Archonstorm
(basically, combinatorial explosion of Archons). Few people can survive
those; the problem is basically that if you kill a monster,
another monster will take its place, so you don't get to move.

They're more likely to get off the ground if you're a higher level, or
if you've genocided a lot of monsters (particularly nasties). I've heard
that they can't happen with no genocides, but don't know this for
certain; anyone care to confirm/deny?

